  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PAO support SILC 2006</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PAO-st&#xf6;d SILC 2006</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Swedish International Liberal Centre (SILC) inkom till Sida  2006-02-13 med en ans&#xf6;kan/&#xe5;rsplan om medel f&#xf6;r verksamhet under 2006. SILC planerar enligt den aktuella ans&#xf6;kan verksamhet i bl a  Somaliland, Elfenbenskusten, Bosnien-Hercegovina, Serbien, Ukraina, Ryssland samt n&#xe5;gra globala insatser.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Swedish International Liberal Centre&apos;s (SILC)application for support during 2006 was received by Sida on 13 February 2006. Projects are planned in inter alia Somaliland, the Ivory Coast,  Bosnia-Herzegovina, Serbia, the Ukraine, Russia and globally.</narrative>
  </description>
